      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>Return value for getSelectionModeForCategory(String).</para>
          <para>In this mode, when using ISO-DEP card emulation with HostApduService or OffHostApduService, whenever an Application ID (AID) of this category is selected, the user is asked which service they want to use to handle the transaction, even if there is only one matching service.</para>
